  "summary": "Payload Form Builder has an RCE issue",
  "details": "## Impact\n\nA vulnerability in `@payloadcms/plugin-form-builder` in versions < 3.90.0 allow submissions which could be crafted to execute remote code on the server.\n\n**You are affected if:**\n\n- You are using `@payloadcms/plugin-form-builder`\n\n## Patches\n\nUsers should upgrade Payload packages to `>= 3.90.0` or `>= 4.0.0-canary.34`.",
